### Housekeeping.

## Which operation or input was refused: the first words of the error.

# The branch merged branches are compared with.
housekeeping-what-base = base
housekeeping-what-branch-name = branch name
housekeeping-what-description = description
housekeeping-what-describe = describe
housekeeping-what-delete-merged = delete merged

## Why.

housekeeping-too-long = is too long
# The name, quoted.
housekeeping-base-unknown = { $name } is neither a local branch nor a branch of a remote
housekeeping-no-branch = there is no branch { $name }
housekeeping-description-control = must not hold control characters other than line breaks and tabs
housekeeping-no-base = there is no branch to compare with; say which one
housekeeping-moved = { $name } moved in the meantime; it was kept
